	[I snarfed this off the net back in 1983 and have no idea
	 who did it (the header wasn't saved).  This is a file,
	 which when uudecoded should be directly cat'd to your terminal.
	 It is full of VT100 (ANSI) escape sequences to display a
	 Christmas picture.  (It really looks nice on my Tek4107
	 color terminal.)  Although this is not "source", I felt it
	 was appropriate for this newsgroup for this time of year.
	 Merry Christmas!	-br]
	[P.S. If the original author is around, speak up and I'll
	 give you your credit.]

